# pkg/convert/bruno/native_url_sanitize.go
# Bruno-native source sanitization. These rewrite the retained source artifact
# for review, which is deliberately lossy -- the opposite requirement from the
# credentialpolicy projection that governs a value into {{secret.NAME}}.
# Collapsing the two would make the review artifact re-executable.
policy:pkg/convert/bruno/native_url_sanitize.go:nativeHTTPParamsContainSensitiveCredentials
